    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43946" root="&#xA;                        نسع&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِسْعٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A plaited thong, serving for the noserein of a camel,</i> &amp;c., and sometimes <i>woven
wide,</i> [<i>for a fore-girth,</i>] <i>placed on the breast of a
camel.</i> (KL, TA.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِسْعَةٌ</span>.

